    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dimly lit bowels of an abandoned clockwork dreadnought, the air thick with the smell of grease and escaping steam. Hissing pipes and grinding gears echo through the labyrinth of rusted iron corridors. Your only hope of escaping this mechanical tomb before its boiler goes critical is to locate the final blueprint hidden deep within the ship's mechanical heart. To find it, you must decipher the interconnected logic of the dreadnought's archaic brass machinery, navigating a path of cryptic engines and pneumatic locks.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
